_admin":false},"body":"\r\n## What problem(s) does this PR solve?\r\n\r\nThe error list in the debugger's error tab has collapsed non-visible information that must be copied to the clipboard individually per-error in order to see what line number or file an error even occurred at.  The export button allows the user to conveniently export the entire list of errors into a text file with all detail intact.\r\n\r\nIt was a feature I wanted and implemented for myself and have been using it for some days now, and thought it seemed generally useful and a simple enough change that it was worth contributing.  Sorry if I've interrupted your process in any way.\r\n\r\n## Additional information\r\nAI Usage: Claude Code identified the approach and wrote the code.  I just reviewed and tested it.","labels":[{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null}],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-06-25T22:58:16Z","updated_at":"2026-06-26T08:15:50Z","closed_at":"2026-06-26T08:15:47Z","merged_at":null,"merge_commit_sha":"4a5133fab66804f6bc57c7f74cf703a16add50f7","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"abnormalous-jones:feature/debugger-error-export","ref":"feature/debugger-error-export","repo":{"id":1280728575,"node_id":"R_kgDOTFZd_w","name":"godot","full_name":"abnormalous-jones/godot","owner":{"login":"abnormalous-jones","id":268079158,"node_id":"U_kgDOD_qQNg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/268079158?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abnormalous-jones","html_url":"https://github.com/abnormalous-jones","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abnormalous-jones/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abnormalous-jones/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://